  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The traced path",
      "items": [
        "The handler reads only what its decision needs, across any number of entities — no aggregate drawn in advance",
        "The fold that produced the state also produces the Query the append is conditioned on",
        "ConditionViolated is a typed variant, so the loop re-decides from a pristine model rather than parsing an error"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two ports, two flavours",
      "items": [
        "EventStore carries no Send bound so it compiles on wasm32; trait_variant derives SendEventStore from it",
        "read returns the stream at the top level and is not async — nesting it would silently drop + Send",
        "ProjectionStore is behind unstable-projection and is not frozen; no two unlike batch shapes have settled it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Instruments, and the gate",
      "items": [
        "Memory, RefCell, rusqlite and a Durable Object all assign positions under a lock — four adapters, one shape",
        "Postgres allocates positions outside the transaction and Neon has no cursor at all; both exist to sit elsewhere",
        "89 rules, 5 concurrency rules at 64 contenders, a model family — and every rule has a mutant that fails it"
      ]
    }
  ]
